    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "How to investigate",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Open log details and click **View trace** on JSON completion records. Or use [Tempo Explore](/explore) and paste the API response `X-Trace-ID`.\n\nCounters reset with app processes; worker metrics measure handler completion, not Kafka lag or offset commits. Notification delivery is simulated. Rates need at least two exports; sparse traffic can leave p95 empty. HTTP 4xx are separate from 5xx in the outcome panels.\n\nFiltros no topo: servico; HTTP (rota/metodo/status); Kafka (topico/resultado); logs (nivel/texto/Trace ID). **Texto e Trace ID sao buscas literais**. Filtros HTTP nao ocultam logs dos workers; filtros Kafka nao ocultam logs HTTP. Niveis/rotas explicitos podem excluir mensagens antigas sem campos JSON."
      },
      "description": "Servico filtra este painel. Filtros HTTP/Kafka afetam suas respectivas metricas; nivel, texto e Trace ID afetam somente logs."
